diff --git a/Shaders/VolFog/NOTICE-modificaciones.txt b/Shaders/VolFog/NOTICE-modificaciones.txt
index 817d8e8..a8be407 100644
--- a/Shaders/VolFog/NOTICE-modificaciones.txt
+++ b/Shaders/VolFog/NOTICE-modificaciones.txt
@@ -88,3 +88,30 @@ Modifications (GPLv3 section 5a), dated
   - vf_march.hlsl, vf_composite.hlsl/.hlsli, vf_integrate.hlsli and vf_local_lights.hlsli are unchanged: the LOCAL_LIGHTS = 1 permutations were already
     compiled in B6 and are chosen here when at least one light is uploaded.
